<title>UK: Goldman Sachs prices 1.0 billion French franc bond.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs prices 1.0 billion French franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced, joint lead managers Caisse des Depots et Consignations, Credit Lyonnais and Goldman Sachs said on Tuesday.  BORROWER   GOLDMAN SACHS OVERSEAS FINANCE LP</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  GOLDMAN SACHS GROUP</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN FRF   COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    21.AUG.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.515    PAY DATE    21.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.45	REOFFER    99.515    SPREAD	+53 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    LUX/PARIS PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 10-100-1M SALE LIMITS US/GB/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  0.25	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
